    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Bone Knight Dedication</p><hr /><p>You learn to infuse bonecraft weapons with dormant necromantic marrow. When you wield a bonecraft weapon you crafted, your Strikes deal an additional 1d4 void damage (or cold damage, representing the chill of the grave). Furthermore, your bonecraft weapons gain the <em>deadly d6</em> trait; if the weapon already possesses the deadly trait, its deadly die increases by one step (to a maximum of d12).</p>"
